      "category": "pure",
      "scope": "event",
      "guidance": "Prefer explicit health predicates over legacy hearts_at_*. Require the event player's raw GetHearts() <= amount in half-heart units. Includes rotten occupancy and red filling in bone hearts; do not add rotten health or bone shells again. Keeper uses engine coin-health values. Never normalize special characters or aggregate twins/subplayers. Missing or invalid queries fail closed.",
