      "summary": "empty red capacity at least {amount} half-hearts",
      "params": {
        "amount": {
          "type": "integer",
          "required": true,
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 24
        }
      },
      "category": "pure",
      "scope": "event",
      "guidance": "Require max(0, GetEffectiveMaxHearts() - GetHearts()) >= amount for the event player in half-heart units. Effective capacity includes bone-heart filling space; rotten occupancy is already in GetHearts. Zero capacity satisfies only amount zero. Do not invent capacity for The Lost or aggregate twins. Missing or invalid queries fail closed.",
